["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/givenRole", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "givenRole is a property that specifies the role being assigned in a RoleRelationship. It links the relationship to an instance of the Role class, defining the function, responsibility, or position that the source element confers upon the target element.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
